{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City where danger lurks around every corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drug cartels, corrupt police, manipulative media, and terror \u2014 all tied into one knot, pulled by a city hall rotten to its core. Here, people don\u2019t live \u2014 they survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a detective, once a symbol of justice, now a forgotten drunk clinging to memories of better days. But the past won\u2019t let go, and the fate of the city suddenly falls into your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can one person challenge the whole system \u2014 or will the city finally drown in darkness? And who is the shadow pushing you forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noir pixel atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that influence the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogues with skill checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations from dark basements to a train speeding through a snowy desert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh moral dilemmas.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961240?t=1755710770","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961240/b56d5d57285a4b03db2069e5c8e91510037cf498/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755710770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961240/dbd134dafc0b10d432d682ef321bf19d9c1b4394/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755710770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961240/dbd134dafc0b10d432d682ef321bf19d9c1b4394/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755710770","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"It contains episodic graphic violence and gore, several strong obscenities, and infrequent nudity from the front."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City where danger lurks around every corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drug cartels, corrupt police, manipulative media, and terror \u2014 all tied into one knot, pulled by a city hall rotten to its core. Here, people don\u2019t live \u2014 they survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a detective, once a symbol of justice, now a forgotten drunk clinging to memories of better days. But the past won\u2019t let go, and the fate of the city suddenly falls into your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can one person challenge the whole system \u2014 or will the city finally drown in darkness? And who is the shadow pushing you forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noir pixel atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that influence the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogues with skill checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations from dark basements to a train speeding through a snowy desert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh moral dilemmas.</p></li></ul>","developers":["vonka"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2833880","name":"Antidote city hall"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961240/27a767244ff36fa208bbde526692853b9084dc8e/header.jpg?t=1755710770","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Antidote city hall Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["vonka game studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia\nAtos criminosos","rating":"12","r